1873	/// Characters the dialect lowers into structure: lists, headings, quotes,
1874	/// tables and fences. Losing one of these to formatting is the formatter
1875	/// working; losing anything else that is not whitespace is losing content.
1876	const STRUCTURAL_MARKUP: [char; 7] = ['-', '*', '#', '>', '|', '+', '`'];
