 9592	/// evidence kinds. Existence checks alone let a packet remap broad, unrelated
 9593	/// test names to satisfy coverage; this registry makes the authoritative
 9594	/// mapping tamper-evident (P1-A04). Recompute with the canonical NUL/US stream
 9595	/// below and update this constant in the same commit as any test inventory edit.
 9596	const TEST_REGISTRY_SHA256: &str =
 9597	    "7a29add0e81657e17786934010638abf1ea99dfee4e162921a9ef2699197d447";
