10634	/// Whether `anchor` could be the `before` text of `operator`'s prescribed
10635	/// mutation. `verify_mutant_operator_patch` states the lexical contract over
10636	/// both sides of a patch, but no patch exists at stage 1a, so that contract
10637	/// had never been applied to an anchor: six mutants declared operators their
10638	/// anchor could not support, including a `predicate-deletion` on a line with
