 10664	/// which, so this operator's reach is not lexically decidable, and pretending
 10665	/// otherwise is how P1-M047 came to declare a mutation no patch could
 10666	/// implement. The set is closed and shared with
 10667	/// `verify_mutant_operator_patch`: one statement of where the operator
 10668	/// applies, not two that can drift.
 10669	const WRONG_HOLDER_ANCHORS: [&str; 2] = [
 10670	    "&self.basis",
